 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** The complexity is dominated by the matrix inversions and multiplications in `get_world_rays` and the cross product and division in `intersect_rays`. For `N` points, it is $O(N)$ assuming fixed-size matrix operations [G].
